   "id": "yb-6-2-algo",
   "h": "Algorithm: Hemolytic anemia (Intrinsic vs Extrinsic RBC cause)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y62a\"></div><p><b>Hemolytic anemia</b> แบ่งเป็น Intrinsic RBC cause และ Extrinsic RBC cause</p><ul><li><b>Intrinsic RBC cause</b><ul><li><b>Structural</b>: Membranopathies (HS, HE) · Enzymopathies (G-6PD deficiency) · Hemoglobinopathies (Homozygous Hb CS, Thalassemia)</li><li><b>Acquire</b>: PNH</li></ul></li><li><b>Extrinsic RBC cause</b><ul><li><b>Immune</b>: Autoimmune (Lymphoproliferative: Lymphoma, CLL · Autoimmune: SLE, RA, PAN, WG, UCTD · Infection: EBV, Mycoplasma · CA: ovary · Drug: Penicillin, Cephalosporin) / Alloimmune (Transfusion reaction)</li><li><b>Microangiopathies</b>: TTP, HUS, DIC, Severe PreEclampsia, HELLP syndrome, Malignant HT, Prosthesis valve</li><li><b>Infection</b>: Malaria, Clostridium</li><li><b>Chemical agent</b>: Spider venom</li></ul></li></ul><p>โน้ตลายมือ:</p><ul><li><b>HS</b>: <span class=\"hw\">ซีดตอนมีไข้</span> · <span class=\"hw\">MCHC↑ จาก CBC</span> · <span class=\"hw\">no pallor จาก PBS</span></li><li><b>G-6PD deficiency</b>: <span class=\"hw\">Bite cell, Hb leakage</span></li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "ap-acute",
   "html": "<p><b>โน้ตลายมือในเล่มเหลือง (Hemolytic anemia)</b></p><ul><li><b>HS</b> (Hereditary spherocytosis): <span class=\"hw\">ซีดตอนมีไข้</span> · <span class=\"hw\">MCHC↑ จาก CBC</span> · <span class=\"hw\">no pallor จาก PBS</span></li><li><b>G-6PD deficiency</b>: <span class=\"hw\">Bite cell, Hb leakage</span></li></ul>"
  }
 ],
